WEBVTT

00:00:00.490 --> 00:00:07.210
♪ A miracle born in a wavering
moment clad in crimson scarlet ♪

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:09.460
Crow has arrived!

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:11.840
♪ Shaken by darkness,
disappearing into darkness ♪

00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:16.050
♪ Clothed in a forbidden wave of black ♪

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:18.260
Black Monster, Aion.

00:00:18.470 --> 00:00:21.770
♪ He is after the spirit to rule over
all the savage living things on earth ♪

00:00:21.970 --> 00:00:23.980
♪ The Way of Ryukomuso Kamui... ♪

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:27.400
Hence, Yaiba appears bearing
his legendary Ryukenden.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:30.730
♪ Grown men have a spice called secrecy ♪

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.400
♪ That is the true reality ♪

00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.280
♪ I am Rom! ♪

00:00:36.490 --> 00:00:38.870
♪ Sing, you cattle ♪

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:41.160
♪ Be dyed in crimson ♪

00:00:41.370 --> 00:00:44.120
♪ Your eyes will change fate ♪

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:54.050
♪ SHINGANCRIMSONZ ♪

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:09.400
<i>Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO!</i>

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:12.230
<i>Love life! Very! Very! Happy!</i>

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:15.030
<i>Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping!</i>

00:01:15.240 --> 00:01:17.740
<i>Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK?</i>

00:01:17.950 --> 00:01:20.700
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:01:20.910 --> 00:01:26.330
<i>Rushing out onto the road to</i>
<i>school with the blue sky behind us</i>

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>I like that! I like this, too!</i>

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:31.790
<i>I'll take it all, all of it~</i>

00:01:32.000 --> 00:01:34.670
<i>A girl who imagines love is all romance</i>

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:37.420
<i>If I can attack, I'll do it boldly</i>

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:42.050
<i>Let's find an original vision for the future</i>

00:01:42.260 --> 00:01:47.980
<i>Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time</i>

00:01:48.180 --> 00:01:50.810
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:58.360
<i>You've got a green light for love now!</i>
<i>It's your chance to move forward!</i>

00:01:58.570 --> 00:01:59.200
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:02.200
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:02:02.410 --> 00:02:04.280
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.370
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:08.000
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:09.870
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:02:10.080 --> 00:02:13.420
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:02:13.630 --> 00:02:15.500
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:02:15.710 --> 00:02:18.800
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:02:19.010 --> 00:02:22.010
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:26.890
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:30.850
Oi, Aion!

00:02:31.060 --> 00:02:34.480
You came in and cut me off before
I was done just now, didn't you?!

00:02:34.690 --> 00:02:37.480
You foolish and weak rodent.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:42.320
In front of me, the dark sun god,
your shouts are little more than dust—

00:02:42.530 --> 00:02:46.200
Shut up, Wimpion!
<i>You</i> can't even talk without posing!

00:02:46.410 --> 00:02:48.790
And Yaiba! Your line is too long!

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:50.460
You always sound like you're about to mess up!

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:51.660
Stop making me nervous!

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:55.290
This is the essence of the
Way of Ryukomuso Kamui.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:03:00.800
Hence, we shorten <i>your</i> time,
since you are short in stature.

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:08.560
Oh? It seems the two of
you want your souls erased...

00:03:09.470 --> 00:03:12.640
I summon Red Tomahawk!

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:18.730
You are foolish to defy a god. Come and get me!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.910
I summon Holy Ark!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:28.330
Then I must not be left out!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.700
Come, Ryukenden!

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.000
Shut up!

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:42.920
Jeezus, you guys are always, <i>always</i> fighting!

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:46.050
We are crimson souls

00:03:46.260 --> 00:03:50.350
gathered at the foot of the destiny
called a "band," sharing the same fate

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:52.850
to carve a legend into music history.

00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:54.230
Am I right?!

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:58.770
As expected of a man with a
full-time job. His words are persuasive!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:01.360
You're the best, Rom.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:03.650
To even be able to convince a god...

00:04:03.860 --> 00:04:06.360
All right! Let's do it today, too!

00:04:06.570 --> 00:04:07.780
We are...

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:10.540
SHINGANCRIMSONZ!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:16.460
They are the other band
that is part of this agency.

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:21.550
Our agency only has
SHINGANCRIMSONZ and Plasmagica, pyuru.

00:04:23.420 --> 00:04:24.840
Oi, what's going on?

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:28.140
Why is there cattle in the
place where we polish our souls?

00:04:28.340 --> 00:04:29.550
Cattle...?

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:33.730
Her name is Cyan. She's our new member!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.520
She's not a fan of SHINGANCRIMSONZ, pyuru!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:41.320
Anyway, you guys should
stop calling your fans "cattle."

00:04:41.520 --> 00:04:42.780
What did you say?!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:47.070
It cannot be helped.
Crow's parents are dairy farmers. Hence—

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:51.330
Shaddup! I drank milk every day,
but I didn't grow any taller!

00:04:51.530 --> 00:04:53.330
Dairy... farmers...?

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.790
Don't make fun of dairy farmers!

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:59.290
Cyan hasn't developed a
resistance to you guys yet!

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:01.750
Will you please refrain from talking to her?

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:07.050
Resistance? Yeah, you won't
be able to resist our success!

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.590
We will polish our burning souls...

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:12.930
...and stand at the top of Midi City one day!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.770
We are SHING—

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:31.950
It's just as I thought!

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.620
Now that Cyan has joined,

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:39.670
Plasmagica can raise the curtain on the
second chapter of our lovely music legend!

00:05:39.870 --> 00:05:41.170
R-Really?

00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:43.380
It's obvious, pyuru!

00:05:43.590 --> 00:05:47.090
You don't have to hold back...
You can do more, you know.

00:05:47.300 --> 00:05:54.390
I-It was my first time playing
with other people like this...

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:59.520
...but it was really fun.
Um... I'm glad you asked...

00:06:03.980 --> 00:06:06.860
Let's stop here for today.

00:06:07.860 --> 00:06:10.610
There's a café on the
first floor of this building.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:13.120
We always eat dinner here.

00:06:13.320 --> 00:06:15.370
Replenishing energy, pyuru!

00:06:15.700 --> 00:06:18.500
Money, money, money...

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:23.080
There are things in this
world that money can't buy!

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:26.800
You're drinking too much.
If you don't drink in moderation—

00:06:27.000 --> 00:06:29.380
We are in the business of selling dreams!

00:06:29.590 --> 00:06:32.390
Our job is to produce good music!

00:06:32.590 --> 00:06:34.260
It's not to make money!

00:06:34.470 --> 00:06:37.680
It's not to make money...

00:06:37.970 --> 00:06:40.350
Jeez, you're so loud, Prez!

00:06:41.730 --> 00:06:42.560
Welcome.

00:06:42.770 --> 00:06:46.770
This is the café the president
runs as a side business.

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:50.110
They've appeared again...

00:06:50.610 --> 00:06:52.660
Here you are. Eat up!

00:06:56.660 --> 00:06:57.830
It's delicious!

00:06:58.040 --> 00:06:59.540
Right?

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:02.120
Hey, look at that!

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:04.210
Every day, we drink

00:07:04.420 --> 00:07:06.840
Dream Galactica Cider!

00:07:08.670 --> 00:07:10.300
We're the dream galaxy idols—

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.800
Trichronika!

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:19.220
You should drink this and
search for the dream galaxy with us!

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.020
That... Th...

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:26.980
That "dream galaxy idol" stuff is
nonsense in front of a god like me.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:30.990
But we don't even have a
proper catchphrase, do we?

00:07:31.190 --> 00:07:34.950
In preparation for the TV commercial
that will come calling one day,

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.280
shall we think about our Legend of Catchphrase?

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:44.210
For example, going after the cries of the
savage dragons born of the flames of purgatory...

00:07:44.420 --> 00:07:45.080
Hence—

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.340
You're talking about your Ryukenden, right?
You're so predictable.

00:07:48.540 --> 00:07:51.010
Spun from the dark and evil but holy psalms—

00:07:51.210 --> 00:07:54.590
You're talking about Black Monster, right?
You're the same as him!

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:57.220
I was wrong to ask you guys.

00:07:57.430 --> 00:07:59.390
Hey, Rom! What about you?

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:01.770
I'm organizing my receipts right now.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:02.930
Don't talk to me.

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:04.060
Huh?

00:08:04.270 --> 00:08:07.060
Oh, Rom works for a company.

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:08.860
He has a full-time job?

00:08:09.070 --> 00:08:10.820
He wears two hats, pyuru.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.400
Wow...

00:08:12.610 --> 00:08:14.780
Hey, Rom. Do that later.

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:17.870
Let's think of something amazing that'll
be better than what Shu☆zo said earlier—!

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:19.410
Shut up!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:21.490
Don't say that guy's name!

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:22.950
What are you doing, Rom?!

00:08:23.160 --> 00:08:25.000
Don't I always tell you not to touch my face?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.210
Keep your trap shut!

00:08:26.420 --> 00:08:30.290
Rom? Your Legend of Violence
seems worse than usual...

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.050
This is stupid!

00:08:32.260 --> 00:08:35.510
What catchphrase? What dream galaxy idol?

00:08:35.720 --> 00:08:36.680
Don't make me laugh!

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:40.890
Isn't our way of living our catchphrase?!

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:47.230
Rom... You're the best...

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.480
Yes?

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:55.950
Speaking... Yes... Yes, yes...

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.910
Yes?! Yes, yes! Yes!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:06.330
There's work for you
gentlemen of SHINGANCRIMSONZ!

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.210
What? What kind of work?!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:11.960
Depending on what it is,
the god may not deign to descend...

00:09:12.170 --> 00:09:14.760
That's true. We should not
agree without careful consideration.

00:09:14.960 --> 00:09:16.010
Hence—

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:19.390
Well? Tell us about the job, Prez!

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:25.560
You'll be the opening act for Trichronika
at tomorrow's concert in Shibu Valley!

00:09:26.230 --> 00:09:27.560
We're going to be the opening act?

00:09:27.770 --> 00:09:32.020
They said that the band that was
supposed to go on all got hurt tummies,

00:09:32.230 --> 00:09:36.610
so the job of pinch hitter
has come suddenly to you all.

00:09:36.820 --> 00:09:40.700
I'm not interested in being
the opening act for an idol bastard.

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:42.200
Later.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.540
Rom.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:49.330
Work is work. You have to take
everything one step at a time...

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:51.130
Right?

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.840
All right! We just have to do it, right?

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.050
Good boy.

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:59.800
Now that that's decided, let's go
all out so we won't lose to them!

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:02.260
He's really going all out, huh?

00:10:02.470 --> 00:10:04.060
He's overexcited for no reason.

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:05.770
I'm used to it, pyuru.

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.770
By the way, Cyan—

00:10:07.980 --> 00:10:11.600
Where do you live?

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:14.570
Um... I live...

00:10:14.770 --> 00:10:18.690
All of us live in the dorm in this building.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:21.820
Do you want to move here, too, Cyan?

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:22.990
Yeah, pyuru!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:26.370
Y-Yeah... I'd like that!

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.960
I'm saved...

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:34.960
Where did you live until now, pyuru?

00:10:35.170 --> 00:10:36.210
Huh?

00:10:36.420 --> 00:10:39.010
In a bunch of places... I moved a lot...

00:10:39.220 --> 00:10:40.420
Running away from home?

00:10:40.630 --> 00:10:43.340
No, that's not it, but...

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:48.180
We shouldn't ask her about this anymore.
She must be in a sad and complicated situation.

00:10:48.390 --> 00:10:52.480
She cannot reveal her true
identity, pyuru? Could she be...?

00:10:52.690 --> 00:10:55.020
Her face when she's troubled...

00:10:58.530 --> 00:11:00.650
Cyan, this is your room.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:04.320
You should talk to the president
about getting furniture and everything.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.330
R-Right.

00:11:06.530 --> 00:11:08.080
Here...

00:11:08.790 --> 00:11:11.120
You don't have pajamas, do you?

00:11:12.830 --> 00:11:14.380
Thank you...

00:11:15.210 --> 00:11:16.920
Well, good night!

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:18.250
Good night, pyuru.

00:11:18.460 --> 00:11:19.880
Y-Yeah...

00:11:21.010 --> 00:11:22.550
'Night...

00:11:23.430 --> 00:11:24.720
I have to tell them...

00:11:24.930 --> 00:11:27.220
I have to tell them properly...

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:29.810
Um...!

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:37.610
Um, uh... g-good night...

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.530
Yeah.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:47.070
Aw... I wanted to thank them
for inviting me to join their band...

00:11:58.500 --> 00:12:02.380
Why did things turn out like this?

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:04.880
Are you homesick already?

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.800
It talked again?!

00:12:08.010 --> 00:12:10.720
Sorry about leaving you alone.

00:12:10.930 --> 00:12:12.890
You must've felt uneasy.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:17.650
Um, I... When I'm alone like this...

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:23.650
I mean, I don't know where I am...
or know anything about this world... so...

00:12:23.860 --> 00:12:29.200
This is one of the twelve city-states
in Sound World, Midi City.

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:31.490
Midi City...?

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:37.670
A cool and chaotic music city, this is
where Myumons, musical beings like us, live.

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:42.800
Everything revolves around music,
and all Myumons love music.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:44.920
Really?

00:12:45.130 --> 00:12:48.760
Um, why do I have these things on me?

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:50.810
Because you've become a Myumon, too.

00:12:51.010 --> 00:12:52.060
Wh-What?

00:12:52.260 --> 00:12:55.730
Don't worry. It's just your
temporary form in this world.

00:12:55.940 --> 00:13:01.150
When Myumons perform, they can
transform into bodies for that purpose.

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.820
The stone that shines in your chest—

00:13:07.030 --> 00:13:14.250
It's a Melodisian stone, the sound energy
hidden within all living beings in this world.

00:13:14.450 --> 00:13:17.750
With excellent music,
it resonates with the audience and

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.880
becomes a crystal of high purity.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:22.500
However, if it comes into
contact with dark music energy,

00:13:22.710 --> 00:13:25.630
it becomes tainted with dark Melodisian.

00:13:27.340 --> 00:13:29.890
This just happened before I knew it...

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:35.180
I am so happy to be able to form a
band with the members of Plasmagica.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:38.350
But why am I in this world?

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:43.940
You are the player chosen to
save this world on the brink of a crisis.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:47.150
Save the world...? Me...?

00:13:47.360 --> 00:13:49.070
I can't do something like that.

00:13:49.280 --> 00:13:54.620
Unfortunately, until you
polish your musical abilities more

00:13:54.830 --> 00:13:58.620
and annihilate the dark monsters
who bring dark music,

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:00.960
you cannot return to your world.

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:02.420
What?!

00:14:02.630 --> 00:14:06.130
But that's... impossible... I can't do it...

00:14:06.340 --> 00:14:09.800
Really? You did a good job
driving the enemy away before.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:11.010
But that was...

00:14:11.220 --> 00:14:14.010
Your performance saved them.

00:14:15.510 --> 00:14:18.520
How about it? Will you do it?

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.150
All right!

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.270
Really? You'll take on the job?

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:29.740
Um, if possible, I'd like to join a
club before the Golden Week holiday,

00:14:29.950 --> 00:14:31.780
so I'd like to go home then.

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:35.280
Until then... I'll somehow...

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.040
♪ So let's just ♪

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.380
♪ Have a blast ♪

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.630
♪ Fall in love ♪

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:51.010
♪ Our youth is non-stop ♪

00:14:51.220 --> 00:14:53.010
♪ Run... ♪

00:15:22.460 --> 00:15:25.330
Baths are so nice, meow!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.920
D-Did you write the song you were humming?

00:15:30.130 --> 00:15:31.880
Yeah, what about it...?

00:15:32.090 --> 00:15:33.680
Try playing it.

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:37.680
What? But I was about to go to sleep...

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:41.770
Yes? Come in.

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:44.230
Do you have a moment?

00:15:45.900 --> 00:15:48.820
This is the first song I ever wrote.

00:15:50.150 --> 00:15:51.940
Wow, it's good.

00:15:52.150 --> 00:15:54.860
And, this is the second.

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.870
Oh, it's cute!
The lyrics are really moving, too.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:00.620
You think so?

00:16:00.830 --> 00:16:03.120
Do you write songs, Cyan?

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.630
Huh? Um, yes, but...

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:08.340
Could it be, the song just now...?

00:16:08.540 --> 00:16:11.460
Huh? Y-You heard it...?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.380
The bath echoes.

00:16:17.050 --> 00:16:18.470
Come in.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.100
You don't have a change of clothes, do you?

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:29.110
Everyone's gathered here after all, pyuru!

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:29.860
Dang it...

00:16:30.070 --> 00:16:32.480
I brought snacks, pyuru!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:36.740
We were all scouted by the president.

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:39.160
Really? Is that how it was?

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:43.660
One day, we want to do a
solo concert at the BooDooKan.

00:16:43.870 --> 00:16:46.170
That's our goal for the time being.

00:16:46.370 --> 00:16:52.170
I, well... like music... but I'm awkward...

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:53.380
I can't say it.

00:16:53.590 --> 00:16:56.800
I can't under any circumstances
say it was to make friends...

00:16:57.010 --> 00:16:59.850
I love music, too, pyuru!

00:17:00.220 --> 00:17:03.520
Pyuru-ru-ru-ru, ru-ru-ru-ru-ru...

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:08.270
Cyan, I'm really glad that you joined us!

00:17:08.480 --> 00:17:09.730
Yeah!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:12.230
I look forward to working with you!

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:16.110
R-Right. Same here!

00:17:21.830 --> 00:17:28.250
I will work hard to practice playing
guitar so I can defeat the monsters.

00:17:28.460 --> 00:17:34.340
After all, I'm truly happy to
have been able to join Plasmagica.

00:17:34.550 --> 00:17:39.430
I think I can work hard for
a while just because of that.

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:43.010
Hm? Is he asleep?

00:17:45.720 --> 00:17:46.680
Shu☆zo!

00:17:46.890 --> 00:17:48.640
Trichronika!

00:17:48.850 --> 00:17:51.770
They didn't say a word in the car, did they?

00:17:51.980 --> 00:17:53.980
Jeez, those guys are so lame.

00:17:54.190 --> 00:17:56.280
I'm worried, pyuru...

00:18:02.530 --> 00:18:04.370
Hey, c'mon!

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:06.660
What're you doing getting nervous <i>now</i>?

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.410
It's pathetic!

00:18:09.040 --> 00:18:11.830
SHINGANCRIMSONZ! You're up!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.960
Rom! Pump us up!

00:18:17.170 --> 00:18:20.720
All right! Let's go, you guys!

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:26.100
Everyone! Welcome to
today's Trichronika concert!

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:29.940
I know you all want to see
Trichronika as soon as possible,

00:18:30.140 --> 00:18:32.560
but please listen to this one song first!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:35.820
SHINGAN... CRIMSONZ!

00:18:36.020 --> 00:18:38.990
Huh? I want to see Shu☆zo as soon as possible!

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:41.240
Boo! Boo!

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:49.830
With our crimson gaze,
we keep watching you and loving you—

00:18:50.040 --> 00:18:53.460
SHINGANCRIMSONZ!

00:18:56.590 --> 00:18:59.210
Let's go, you cattle!

00:19:01.090 --> 00:19:03.050
Cattle...?

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.850
Are you trying to pick a fight with me?!

00:19:07.060 --> 00:19:09.850
Oh dear, he said it...

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:11.350
He's the worst, pyuru.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:16.110
Everyone here is a Trichron fan.
They're not your cattle...

00:19:28.450 --> 00:19:33.040
♪ Cruelly shining, the worst stigma ♪

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.580
♪ Misery, raining down incessantly... ♪

00:19:35.790 --> 00:19:37.960
♪ I can't see anything... ♪

00:19:38.170 --> 00:19:46.970
♪ Ah... my heart covered with scars
flows with crimson, wandering... ♪

00:19:47.180 --> 00:19:49.430
♪ Falling Rose... Falling Rose... ♪

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:56.730
♪ O God, save me... Give me a beam of light... ♪

00:19:56.940 --> 00:19:59.070
- ♪ Falling Rose... Falling Rose... ♪
- Wow, they're changing the atmosphere!

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:05.070
- ♪ These fallen red roses... ♪
- Wow, they're changing the atmosphere!

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:09.370
Bands really are amazing! Music is wonderful!

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:23.090
Now, it's our turn!

00:20:23.300 --> 00:20:25.470
Yes, Shu☆zo!

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.350
Those cattle were ready to be shipped!

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:33.430
Hey, SHINGAN. Thanks for being our opening act.

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:34.770
What did you say?

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:37.810
Didn't you see our glorious crescendo—?

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:42.150
H-Hey, Rom! It'll be bad if you punch him!

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:52.870
We warmed up the crowd for ya.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:54.040
We did.

00:20:54.250 --> 00:20:55.660
Hence.

00:20:57.460 --> 00:20:58.750
Let's go, Kai, Riku!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.540
Okay!

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:13.600
Oh my, good work, boys!

00:21:13.810 --> 00:21:16.180
I was super popular today, too!

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:19.230
Little dwarf, the stares directed
at you were little more than dust

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:22.650
compared to those directed
at me, the Black Monster.

00:21:22.860 --> 00:21:26.700
What greater applause was
there than for my Ryukenden? Hence—

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:28.780
Hey, everyone!

00:21:29.620 --> 00:21:37.660
U-Um... When you let me join
the band, I was really happy... um...

00:21:37.870 --> 00:21:40.080
Thank you so much!

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:48.300
Oh?

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:52.850
So <i>that's</i> Plasmagica?

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:03.020
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:03.230 --> 00:22:05.900
<i>You can do it because you like it</i>

00:22:06.110 --> 00:22:08.610
<i>The feeling that you like music</i>

00:22:08.820 --> 00:22:11.990
<i>Can't be stopped by anyone</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:20.420
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:20.620 --> 00:22:22.630
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:23.590 --> 00:22:26.170
<i>Running through my body</i>

00:22:26.380 --> 00:22:28.720
<i>This electric thrill</i>

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:33.720
<i>Is this feeling curiosity?</i>

00:22:34.850 --> 00:22:37.270
<i>Negativity is a decrescendo</i>

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:39.940
<i>Hope and expectations, a crescendo</i>

00:22:40.140 --> 00:22:45.480
<i>Show off our passion and</i>
<i>get god to be our ally, too</i>

00:22:45.690 --> 00:22:50.990
<i>I wanna share with everyone and have a taste of</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:54.700
<i>Big!! Rocking!! Heart-throbbing!! Happiness!!!!</i>

00:22:55.700 --> 00:22:58.750
<i>If it's you, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:58.950 --> 00:23:01.750
<i>You can do it because it's you</i>

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:06.840
<i>Let's try performing these</i>
<i>dream-colored notes together</i>

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:10.050
<i>I want to tell you directly</i>

00:23:10.260 --> 00:23:12.880
<i>A life-sized, "heart-sized" heart</i>

00:23:13.090 --> 00:23:15.760
<i>In order for it to reach you...</i>

00:23:15.970 --> 00:23:19.100
<i>I will sing with all I have</i>

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:21.850
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:22.060 --> 00:23:23.810
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:27.980
<i>That</i> band is finally making
its appearance next week!

00:23:28.190 --> 00:23:29.990
What do you mean, "that band"?

00:23:30.190 --> 00:23:34.070
An MG band! Middle school girls! Yay!

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:37.830
- President... Your excitement... It's gross.
- They're not big! They're not small!

00:23:38.030 --> 00:23:39.700
They're in the middle!
